WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:02.000
Focus Mode is off. Choose a duration: here, 15 minutes.

00:02.000 --> 00:05.500
Start Focus. The countdown begins and five sites are blocked.

00:05.500 --> 00:09.500
To stop early, choose End early and type: Yes, this is an emergency.

00:09.500 --> 00:12.000
Continue, then confirm: Yes — End Focus Mode. Or choose No — Keep Focusing.

00:12.000 --> 00:14.200
Focus Mode is off again and the sites open normally.
